From 1e2989ebd45ea0e5fc49c6884d59ae697f9fa46f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zimbatm <zimbatm@zimbatm.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:13:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] pnpm_12: bump webpki-root-certs to 1.0.10 and rustls-webpki
 to 0.103.16

eMudhra and Sectigo revoked eight eMudhra intermediates on 2026-10-18.
pnpm 12 uses the system trust store first.
It falls back to its compiled-in webpki-root-certs list when no system store loads.
webpki-root-certs 1.0.10 removes emSign ECC Root CA - G3 from that list.
rustls-webpki 0.103.16 rejects the eight revoked intermediates on both paths.
webpki-roots (used through sqlx-core) also goes to 1.0.10.

Category: compiled into a binary (#576544).

Assisted-by: Claude Code (claude-opus-5)
---
 .../tools/pnpm/12-bump-webpki.patch           | 44 +++++++++++++++++++
 pkgs/development/tools/pnpm/default.nix       |  5 ++-
 pkgs/development/tools/pnpm/generic-rust.nix  |  3 +-
 3 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pkgs/development/tools/pnpm/12-bump-webpki.patch

diff --git a/pkgs/development/tools/pnpm/12-bump-webpki.patch b/pkgs/development/tools/pnpm/12-bump-webpki.patch
